  "details": "as the title says, if using multi platform-build and publish, the copyright 'modal' appears twice (once when building initially and once when building for the other platform). \n\nSome information is that I build my avatars as android>pc instead of pc>android (since android is more restrictive and i'd like to be able to see if there's any blocking components on the avatar before batch uploading) so it may only be using that workflow. Either way, it should not appear twice since that completely defeats the point of multi-platform build and publish.",
